  m_Name: Lore-en-2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  language: 0
  title: 
  text: 'The cost of that investigation tore apart the mind of Ethan Myers. Years
    have passed, but Post-Traumatic Stress Disorder (PTSD) keeps him a prisoner.


    At
    any moment, the real world shatters. His vision tunnels, the air becomes hostile,
    and the terror of 1996 comes crawling back.


    The only barrier between Ethan
    and total madness is medication. He needs to stay doped, fighting daily to keep
    the monster he covered from consuming him from within.'
  displayDuration: 30
  isSkippable: 1
